<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <Version>1.0.0</Version>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) 2026 Nikolay Kostov</Copyright>
    <Authors>Nikolay.IT</Authors>
    <Product>Backgammon (Табла) Game Engine</Product>
    <PackageId>BackgammonGameEngine</PackageId>
    <Description>Game engine for табла, the Bulgarian family of backgammon games: обикновена (права), гюлбара, тапа, челеби and the traditional среща match. Matches are driven one action at a time, with injected dice for provably fair hosts, per-seat views, replayable match records and move helpers for user interfaces.</Description>
    <PackageTags>backgammon;tabla;табла;tavla;tavli;plakoto;gul bara;narde;board game;game engine</PackageTags>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/NikolayIT/BackgammonGameEngine</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageIcon>Logo_300x300.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
1.0.0 (the first release)

- BackgammonMatch: табла matches driven one action at a time (Start, ToMove, Validate, Act, Stop) for обикновена,
  гюлбара, тапа, челеби and the среща rotation, played to 3 (5 for a среща) with the lead rule.
- Every die from an injected source, in a documented order, and a record that accounts for every draw.
- Escalating doubles from each player's 4th roll, with remainders passed to the opponent; тапа pins, the майка and
  the double-mother draw; марс; the stuck rule.
- Per-seat views and match records as plain JSON-serializable models; exact replay from a record.
- BackgammonStageMoves: outcomes, legal next steps, destinations and dice left for tap-to-move boards.
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/NikolayIT/BackgammonGameEngine</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <!-- Every public member is documented: CS1591 reports one that is not, and CI treats it as an error. -->
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Backgammon.AI" />
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Backgammon.Logic.Tests" />
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Backgammon.AI.Tests" />
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Backgammon.Arena" />
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="Backgammon.Trainer" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\assets\Logo_300x300.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
    <None Include="README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
